<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good-bye, Iruka-sensei!</font>

43
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good-bye!</font>

44
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Make sure you practice what
