45
00:01:48,330 --> 00:01:53,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And tell your family about tomorrow's
inauguration for the Fifth Hokage!</font>

46
00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:55,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Okay!
— Okay.</font>

47
00:01:59,300 --> 00:02:00,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru!</font>

48
00:02:00,930 --> 00:02:03,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Iruka-sensei?</font>

49
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:05,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... it's all right.</font>

50
00:02:06,430 --> 00:02:07,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you tomorrow!</font>

51
00:02:07,730 --> 00:02:10,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay... Goodbye, Iruka-sensei!</font>

52
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:15,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like he got over it.</font>

53
00:02:19,820 --> 00:02:20,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Lee!</font>

54
00:02:22,990 --> 00:02:24,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On your way back from rehabilitation?</font>

55
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:26,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Um... yes...</font>

56
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hope you get better soon.</font>

57
00:02:30,670 --> 00:02:31,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you very much.</font>

58
00:02:48,270 --> 00:02:51,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To activate each and
every cell all at once...</font>

59
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it were just one by one,
it'd be a snap,</font>

60
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:56,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but all of them together
is gonna be tough.</font>

61
00:02:57,490 --> 00:02:58,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Still...</font>

62
00:03:25,050 --> 00:03:28,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf Village is
in great trouble right now,</font>

63
00:03:28,770 --> 00:03:31,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so we must do our best!</font>

64
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:36,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think if you had Tsunade-sama take
a look, you'd get better very quickly.</font>

65
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:40,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's better that you give up being
a Shinobi and look for a different path.</font>

66
