<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Bond Between the</font>

67
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:52,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Hot-Blooded Teacher</font>

