00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:52,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">and</font>

69
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:52,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Pupil</font>

70
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:52,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">When a Man Follows
His Ninja Way</font>

71
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:52,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">~</font>

72
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:52,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">~</font>

73
00:03:59,260 --> 00:04:00,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clone Jutsu!</font>

74
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:08,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transformation Jutsu!</font>

75
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, young kid...</font>

76
00:04:19,980 --> 00:04:22,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The medal of youth is one of passion,
with no looking back!</font>

77
00:04:23,150 --> 00:04:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you work hard at it,</font>

78
00:04:24,780 --> 00:04:28,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you, son,
you will become a fine Shinobi! Yay!</font>

79
00:04:31,950 --> 00:04:34,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is he?
He is pretty overbearing.</font>

80
00:04:35,790 --> 00:04:39,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Son, be ambitious! Bloom of Youth...</font>

81
00:04:39,750 --> 00:04:42,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then, adieu.</font>

82
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:51,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was the first time I met Guy-sensei.</font>

83
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then...</font>

84
00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:57,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today, you have all become Genin.</font>

85
00:04:58,190 --> 00:05:00,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to hear what
your goals are for the future.</font>

86
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to answer.</font>

87
00:05:08,700 --> 00:05:10,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I...!</font>

88
00:05:10,990 --> 00:05:13,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to prove that
I could become a splendid Ninja,</font>

89
00:05:13,750 --> 00:05:16,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even though I can't use
Ninjutsu or Genjutsu!</font>

90
00:05:17,630 --> 00:05:19,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That would be the ultimate for me!</font>

91
00:05:19,710 --> 00:05:21,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those are good serious eyes...</font>

92
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:23,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You! What's so funny?!</font>

93
00:05:24,170 --> 00:05:25,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm serious!</font>

94
00:05:25,550 --> 00:05:29,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will become a respectable Ninja
even only with Taijutsu!</font>

95
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:33,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you realize that
if you can't use Ninjutsu or Genjutsu,</font>

96
00:05:33,470 --> 00:05:35,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're not a Ninja in the first place?</font>

97
00:05:36,890 --> 00:05:39,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you remember being told
that you're the first person</font>

98
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:41,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to graduate from the academy
who's only able to use Taijutsu?</font>

99
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:46,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not because you're so good;
it's just that you're unusual.</font>

100
00:05:46,990 --> 00:05:47,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Why...!</font>

101
00:05:52,450 --> 00:05:56,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen up! If you have passion,
it's not necessarily so.</font>

102
00:06:02,300 --> 00:06:03,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you act with passion,</font>

103
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:05,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">compete with good rivals
and lift each other up,</font>

104
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:07,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can all become great Ninja!</font>

105
00:06:09,220 --> 00:06:10,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you know,
you have to work hard!</font>

106
00:06:11,180 --> 00:06:12,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Passion...</font>

107
00:06:14,020 --> 00:06:16,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... was inspired by Guy-sensei.</font>

108
00:06:17,770 --> 00:06:20,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By his words... and his deeds.</font>

109
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:31,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're late!
17 minutes and 32 seconds late!</font>

110
00:06:32,330 --> 00:06:34,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's not do it today, all right?</font>

111
00:06:34,660 --> 00:06:36,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Each of us has 48 wins!</font>

112
00:06:36,790 --> 00:06:38,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With a win today,
one of us will pull ahead!</font>

113
00:06:42,130 --> 00:06:44,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess you won't give up
even if I say I wouldn't want to do it.</font>

114
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:49,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's my turn to choose the event, right?</font>

115
00:06:49,260 --> 00:06:51,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right! What's it gonna be?</font>

116
00:06:51,550 --> 00:06:53,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Taijutsu battle? A 100-meter dash?</font>

117
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Holding our breath underwater?</font>

118
00:06:55,470 --> 00:06:57,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't care, we could even
have an eating contest...</font>

119
00:06:57,930 --> 00:06:59,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please...</font>

120
00:07:10,150 --> 00:07:11,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, then...</font>

121
00:07:11,450 --> 00:07:13,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What?!</font>

122
00:07:15,870 --> 00:07:16,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rock, paper, scissors!</font>

123
00:07:18,750 --> 00:07:20,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rock, paper, scissors?
That's what you choose?</font>

124
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:23,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They say that your luck is
one part of your skill, don't they?</font>

125
00:07:23,710 --> 00:07:28,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Plus, it's a great competition
for testing your observational reflexes...</font>

126
00:07:28,590 --> 00:07:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">R-Right.</font>

127
00:07:31,090 --> 00:07:33,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you get the feeling
Kakashi's just playing around with Guy</font>

128
00:07:33,970 --> 00:07:35,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">'cuz he can't be bothered?</font>

129
00:07:35,970 --> 00:07:37,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what it looks like to me.</font>

130
00:07:38,390 --> 00:07:40,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I accept the battle.
There's no way I'm gonna lose!</font>

131
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I do, I'll walk around the Leaf Village
500 times on my hands!</font>

132
00:07:46,860 --> 00:07:48,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There you go again...</font>

133
00:07:48,990 --> 00:07:50,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promise!</font>

134
00:07:50,780 --> 00:07:51,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here we go...</font>

135
00:07:51,820 --> 00:07:54,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Another one of your special,
self-imposed rules.</font>

136
00:07:54,820 --> 00:07:56,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He can't do that.</font>

137
00:07:56,410 --> 00:07:59,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's ridiculous.
He's acting like a kid.</font>

138
00:08:00,330 --> 00:08:03,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, that's impossible,
even for Guy-sensei.</font>

139
00:08:03,830 --> 00:08:05,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Impossible? Reckless, I'd say!</font>

140
00:08:12,550 --> 00:08:14,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Rock, paper...!
— Rock, paper...!</font>

141
00:08:17,430 --> 00:08:19,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you are.</font>

142
00:08:21,350 --> 00:08:22,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei?</font>

143
00:08:23,390 --> 00:08:24,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How did you know I was here?</font>

144
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:27,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know everything about you.</font>

145
00:08:31,690 --> 00:08:34,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard that you skipped out
on rehabilitation these past two days?</font>

146
00:08:34,910 --> 00:08:35,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't be doing that!</font>

147
00:08:45,750 --> 00:08:47,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I first became Genin...</font>

148
00:08:48,170 --> 00:08:52,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this is where I revealed
my dream, my aspiration.</font>

149
00:08:56,010 --> 00:09:01,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji laughed at me then,
but I meant what I said.</font>

150
00:09:03,980 --> 00:09:06,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to prove that
I could become a splendid Ninja</font>

151
00:09:06,850 --> 00:09:09,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even though I can't use
Ninjutsu or Genjutsu!</font>

152
00:09:10,650 --> 00:09:12,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That would be the ultimate for me!</font>

153
00:09:13,490 --> 00:09:16,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time, you told me...</font>

154
00:09:16,860 --> 00:09:19,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you act with passion,
compete with rivals,</font>

155
00:09:19,490 --> 00:09:21,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can become a fine Ninja.</font>

156
00:09:22,290 --> 00:09:23,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that...</font>

157
00:09:23,660 --> 00:09:25,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to do that, it'd take "effort."</font>

158
00:09:29,250 --> 00:09:30,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was happy to hear that.</font>

159
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Transform!
— Transform!</font>

160
00:09:35,590 --> 00:09:36,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because while at the academy...</font>

161
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:42,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no one, not one friend or teacher,
said that kind of thing to me.</font>

162
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:52,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You put me at ease...</font>

163
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:57,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You opened up a path
just when I was unsure of myself.</font>

164
00:09:57,990 --> 00:10:01,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I realized all I had to do
was try my best.</font>

165
00:10:13,130 --> 00:10:15,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And when I complained that</font>

166
00:10:15,170 --> 00:10:18,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all my efforts couldn't match
the others' natural talents,</font>

167
00:10:18,430 --> 00:10:21,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you told me that I had
a natural talent for effort.</font>

168
00:10:22,970 --> 00:10:28,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was when I learned the importance
of believing in my own strength.</font>

169
00:10:33,270 --> 00:10:38,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The chance of a successful surgery
is probably 50%, at best.</font>

170
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:49,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... this is one time...
even if I try my best...!</font>

171
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:53,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and even if I believe in myself,
there's nothing in the world I can do!</font>

172
00:10:56,550 --> 00:10:59,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei... Please tell me...!</font>

173
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:07,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please tell me.
Can I become like you?</font>

174
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:11,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did this kind of thing
happen only to me?</font>

175
00:11:12,150 --> 00:11:14,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I have my own
Ninja Way to follow,</font>

176
00:11:14,190 --> 00:11:16,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my own dreams and aspirations
that I have to protect and</font>

177
00:11:16,820 --> 00:11:19,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">prove to the world even
if it means dying for...</font>

178
00:11:19,490 --> 00:11:21,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I do?!</font>

179
00:11:22,700 --> 00:11:24,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Eight Inner Gates...</font>

180
00:11:24,580 --> 00:11:27,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this the Forbidden Jutsu that
will destroy the body of the practitioner?</font>

181
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please tell me!</font>

182
00:11:30,580 --> 00:11:32,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm prepared for the worst.</font>

183
00:11:32,250 --> 00:11:34,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please teach me that Forbidden Jutsu!</font>

184
00:11:34,540 --> 00:11:36,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everything is... for my dream!</font>

185
00:11:39,380 --> 00:11:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means everything to me!</font>

186
00:11:54,100 --> 00:11:57,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You tried to become a great Ninja
relying only on Taijutsu...</font>

187
00:11:58,360 --> 00:12:00,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Until now, that's all you had.</font>

188
00:12:03,990 --> 00:12:05,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It must be so painful for you...</font>

189
00:12:05,450 --> 00:12:07,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that it seems that your dreams</font>

190
00:12:07,490 --> 00:12:09,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and all your wishes
are being cruelly taken away.</font>

191
00:12:12,210 --> 00:12:16,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It does not matter what his wishes are,
he should give up on becoming a Shinobi.</font>

192
00:12:20,050 --> 00:12:21,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...</font>

193
00:12:25,180 --> 00:12:30,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want to be free of that pain,
you have to prepare yourself!</font>

194
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:39,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does it mean...
to prepare to give up my dreams?</font>

195
00:12:39,900 --> 00:12:41,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you lose your dreams,</font>

196
00:12:41,740 --> 00:12:44,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will undergo pain even greater
than what you feel now.</font>

197
00:12:45,700 --> 00:12:49,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neither you nor I would be able to
go on living if we lose the Ninja Way!</font>

198
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:52,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What fools we are...</font>

199
00:12:55,830 --> 00:12:58,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee! Have the surgery!</font>

200
00:13:18,310 --> 00:13:21,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How's it going with Cell Activation Jutsu?</font>

201
00:13:22,230 --> 00:13:24,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all about the Chakra, but...</font>

202
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:26,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are so many kinds of cells...</font>

203
00:13:26,660 --> 00:13:29,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">skin cells, internal organ cells,
muscular cells...</font>

204
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:34,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know, it's just a tad difficult
to activate all of them at once.</font>

205
00:13:34,460 --> 00:13:37,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?
"Just a tad," you say?</font>

206
00:13:38,500 --> 00:13:40,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you testing me?</font>

207
00:13:40,170 --> 00:13:41,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

208
00:13:43,170 --> 00:13:45,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm declaring my trust in you.</font>

209
00:14:03,110 --> 00:14:05,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know why,
but just a while ago...</font>

210
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:07,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was remembering the time
when you and Kakashi-sensei</font>

211
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:11,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">were competing
with rock, paper, scissors.</font>

212
00:14:12,030 --> 00:14:13,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time, Kakashi-sensei said</font>

213
00:14:13,620 --> 00:14:16,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that your luck is
one part of your skill, right?</font>

214
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:22,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This surgery is also fifty-fifty,
live or die...</font>

215
00:14:23,460 --> 00:14:24,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

216
00:14:25,130 --> 00:14:26,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's not a game of
rock, paper, scissors!</font>

217
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:33,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you remember what happened
after that, Lee?</font>

218
00:14:42,110 --> 00:14:45,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">500 times around...
It's a promise! Yay!</font>

219
00:14:48,030 --> 00:14:49,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's he doing?!</font>

220
00:15:16,100 --> 00:15:17,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap!</font>

221
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:26,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I lose, I'll walk 500 times
around the Leaf Village, on my hands!</font>

222
00:15:27,530 --> 00:15:28,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a promise!</font>

223
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:33,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He can't do that! That's stupid.
He's acting like a kid.</font>

224
00:15:46,340 --> 00:15:47,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! This is nothing!</font>

225
00:15:57,600 --> 00:16:00,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What are you doing here, Lee?</font>

226
00:16:01,350 --> 00:16:02,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you doing this?</font>

227
00:16:02,940 --> 00:16:07,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei is not here.
In fact, no one is watching.</font>

228
00:16:08,610 --> 00:16:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When a man stands cool with
a Nice-guy pose in front of others,</font>

229
00:16:10,740 --> 00:16:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he should keep his promise,
even if it kills him!</font>

230
00:16:16,950 --> 00:16:18,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a promise!</font>

231
00:16:22,830 --> 00:16:23,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

232
00:16:24,540 --> 00:16:26,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you always do that?</font>

233
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whenever you're about to start
doing something,</font>

234
00:16:28,300 --> 00:16:30,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">why do you always come up
with some kind of crazy rule.</font>

235
00:16:34,550 --> 00:16:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good question, Lee.</font>

236
00:16:36,550 --> 00:16:40,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really know how
to get to the point.</font>

237
00:16:40,470 --> 00:16:44,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, I'll tell you.
But remember, you can't tell anyone else.</font>

238
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:46,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the answer?</font>

239
00:16:46,610 --> 00:16:52,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Making self-rules is nothing less than
a practice which brings me victory!</font>

240
00:16:55,110 --> 00:16:56,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Self-rules...?</font>

241
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:58,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you ready?</font>

242
00:16:58,370 --> 00:17:01,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The point of these rules is that,
when you're going after something,</font>

243
00:17:01,910 --> 00:17:05,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they push you into a real tough spot...</font>

244
00:17:05,040 --> 00:17:07,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about chaining yourself down.</font>

245
00:17:07,460 --> 00:17:10,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For example, on the other side
of the hellish rule that</font>

246
00:17:10,210 --> 00:17:12,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"If I lose at rock, scissors, paper,
I'll do 500 laps" is the idea that</font>

247
00:17:13,010 --> 00:17:14,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"If I do 500 laps,</font>

248
00:17:14,340 --> 00:17:17,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no way I won't be able
to beat Kakashi next time."</font>

249
00:17:17,510 --> 00:17:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They hold power,
the potential of the heavens.</font>

250
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:21,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes...</font>

251
00:17:22,270 --> 00:17:25,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By being chained down
to doing 500 laps,</font>

252
00:17:25,940 --> 00:17:29,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it makes you get serious.</font>

253
00:17:29,190 --> 00:17:32,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even about things like
rock, paper, scissors competitions,</font>

254
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:34,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">which are so trifling otherwise.</font>

255
00:17:35,450 --> 00:17:39,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, even if you lose,
walking around the village 500 times</font>

256
00:17:39,660 --> 00:17:43,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">gives you the benefit
of extremely intense training.</font>

257
00:17:45,210 --> 00:17:46,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see!</font>

258
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:49,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, I've gotta do a little more.
Here we go!</font>

259
00:17:50,040 --> 00:17:53,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going with you!
I have my own "self-rule" which is...</font>

260
00:17:53,670 --> 00:17:56,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hey! Don't push yourself, Lee.</font>

261
00:17:56,630 --> 00:17:59,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I can't keep up with you, I'll...</font>

262
00:17:59,970 --> 00:18:02,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">try even harder!</font>

263
00:18:04,390 --> 00:18:06,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is, I'll aim to be like you.</font>

264
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:11,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if I keep trying,
I'll be able to become a great Ninja!</font>

265
00:18:13,940 --> 00:18:17,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! If that's the case,
then I have an addition to my rule!</font>

266
00:18:18,410 --> 00:18:22,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you can't keep up with me
all the way to the end...</font>

267
00:18:22,530 --> 00:18:25,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll put every ounce of
my being into training you!</font>

268
00:18:27,210 --> 00:18:31,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I train you with all my being,
you'll be able to turn into a fine Ninja!</font>

269
00:18:32,790 --> 00:18:33,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promise!</font>

270
00:18:40,390 --> 00:18:42,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, that's right.</font>

271
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:47,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was the first time you told me about
the "self-rule," wasn't it?</font>

272
00:18:49,350 --> 00:18:50,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your surgery will be a success</font>

273
00:18:50,980 --> 00:18:53,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because you have worked hard
all the way through.</font>

274
00:18:54,780 --> 00:18:57,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have the power to bring
your own future in the heavens.</font>

275
00:18:58,610 --> 00:18:59,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And in the one in a thousand...</font>

276
00:18:59,860 --> 00:19:03,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no, one in a million chance
that something goes wrong...</font>

277
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:07,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will die with you!</font>

278
00:19:14,040 --> 00:19:15,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ever since I met you,</font>

279
00:19:15,840 --> 00:19:20,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my Ninja Way has been to
nurture you into a fine Ninja.</font>

280
00:19:22,220 --> 00:19:23,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promise you!</font>

281
00:19:27,640 --> 00:19:32,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neither you nor I would be able
to go on living if we lose the Ninja Way.</font>

282
00:19:32,690 --> 00:19:34,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What fools we are...</font>

283
00:19:39,610 --> 00:19:42,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">G-Guy-sensei!</font>

284
00:19:53,790 --> 00:19:56,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, let's go, Lee!</font>

285
00:19:56,090 --> 00:19:57,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir!</font>

286
00:20:17,730 --> 00:20:18,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

287
00:20:41,470 --> 00:20:43,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From this day forward,</font>

288
00:20:43,050 --> 00:20:47,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the ruler of the Village Hidden
in the Leaves, the Fifth Hokage!</font>

289
00:21:06,370 --> 00:21:11,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I BELIEVE YOUR PROMISE ITS TRUE HEART TO GIVE ME COURAGE</b></font></font>

290
00:21:06,370 --> 00:21:11,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I believe your promise, it's a true heart gives me courage</b></font></font>

291
00:21:11,370 --> 00:21:16,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

292
00:21:11,370 --> 00:21:16,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

293
00:21:16,340 --> 00:21:21,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>tachidomatta kado ni</b></font></font>

294
00:21:16,340 --> 00:21:21,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>on your still shoulder</b></font></font>

295
00:21:21,150 --> 00:21:25,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>asu e mukau kaze wo kanjiteta</b></font></font>

296
00:21:21,150 --> 00:21:25,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I feel the wind that blows towards tomorrow</b></font></font>

297
00:21:25,780 --> 00:21:31,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>machi no akari hoshikuzu mitai ni</b></font></font>

298
00:21:25,780 --> 00:21:31,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>the city lights are like pieces of stars</b></font></font>

299
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:36,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>futari tsutsumu kedo</b></font></font>

300
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:36,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>that hold us together</b></font></font>

301
00:21:36,390 --> 00:21:45,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>sorezore ni chigau kagayaki ga aru to</b></font></font>

302
00:21:36,390 --> 00:21:45,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>"each one of us glows differently"</b></font></font>

303
00:21:45,700 --> 00:21:48,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>warau kimi ga</b></font></font>

304
00:21:45,700 --> 00:21:48,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you say laughingly</b></font></font>

305
00:21:48,580 --> 00:21:54,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ichiban mabushiku mieru yo</b></font></font>

306
00:21:48,580 --> 00:21:54,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>but you look most dazzling</b></font></font>

307
00:21:54,850 --> 00:21:59,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>yume wa ryuusei no you ni</b></font></font>

308
00:21:54,850 --> 00:21:59,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like a comet</b></font></font>

309
00:21:59,280 --> 00:22:05,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ameagari no niji no you ni</b></font></font>

310
00:21:59,280 --> 00:22:05,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like the rainbow after the storm</b></font></font>

311
00:22:05,430 --> 00:22:13,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>kono kokoro ni hikari wo tsuretekuru</b></font></font>

312
00:22:05,430 --> 00:22:13,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you bring light into my heart</b></font></font>

313
00:22:13,630 --> 00:22:24,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>nayami tsuzukeru koto ga hitotsu no kotae ni naruyo</b></font></font>

314
00:22:13,630 --> 00:22:24,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>being lost can be the answer</b></font></font>

315
00:22:24,310 --> 00:22:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>gomakashitari shinai to chikau no</b></font></font>

316
00:22:24,310 --> 00:22:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>let's promise we won't cheat</b></font></font>

317
00:22:31,750 --> 00:22:36,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

318
00:22:31,750 --> 00:22:36,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

319
00:22:38,620 --> 00:22:40,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn! He has no hole
in his defense.</font>

320
00:22:40,760 --> 00:22:42,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Being impatient won't
do any good, Naruto.</font>

321
00:22:42,380 --> 00:22:43,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Let's utilize the next mission.</font>

322
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:46,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">That's right. The next mission
