323
00:22:46,590 --> 00:22:48,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— Our chance will be at the inn.
— Roger that!</font>

324
00:22:48,930 --> 00:22:51,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Once we get to the inn,
