325
00:22:51,550 --> 00:22:53,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— and then...
— and then...</font>

326
00:22:53,350 --> 00:22:54,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— unmask him at once!
— unmask him at once!</font>

327
00:22:55,520 --> 00:23:00,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"I Want To See, I Want To Know, I Want To Check, Kakashi-sensei's Real Face!"</font>

